{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 151,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        527.015625,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "QuantiFERON-TB IGRAs, either Gold In-Tube or Gold Plus (comparator tests). Outcomes reported",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.6418228149414,
        526.9651489257812,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "5 included unit cost (in US dollars)  per patient, incremental cost–effectiveness ratio (ICER) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.16120147705078,
        526.958984375,
        113.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "incremental net benefit per quality-adjusted life year (QALY) gained. Unit costs considered in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.66120147705078,
        526.8731689453125,
        128.8061981201172
      ],
      "text": "each country included test kit, staff time, laboratory and disposable costs. Costs were considered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94571590423584,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.16119384765625,
        445.6735534667969,
        144.3061981201172
      ],
      "text": "from a health system perspective and did not reflect patient or societal costs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        526.9150390625,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "Given that only information on Diaskintest was available, a univariate sensitivity analysis on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        527.0333251953125,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "TBST unit costs and a comparison of the results of the three strategies was performed to identify",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.952396392822266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.16522216796875,
        527.2284545898438,
        199.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "possible maximum unit costs of new TBSTs, for the strategy to remain cost saving or cost-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        201.66522216796875,
        352.05401611328125,
        214.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "effective, but without specifying a particular type of TBST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        473.239990234375,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "The conclusions were based on the predefined research questions outlined below.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.82704162597656,
        327.6171569824219,
        262.74102783203125
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.6768798828125,
        526.8384399414062,
        286.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "In the eight studies that assessed Diaskintest, most estimated a cost of $1.60 per test. One study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.96168327331543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.1768798828125,
        526.964599609375,
        302.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "evaluated the unit costs considering staff time, consumables and laboratory costs, resulting in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.6768798828125,
        526.9107055664062,
        317.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "a cost of $5.07. This study, using the same costing factors, also estimated the unit cost of C-TST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992648124694824,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        320.1769104003906,
        526.9635009765625,
        333.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "as $9.96. The 29 studies on IGRAs or the TST (or both) estimated an average cost of $37.84 for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.6769104003906,
        526.9655151367188,
        348.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "the TST and $89.33 for IGRAs (accounting for different ingredients). The cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        351.1769104003906,
        526.9810180664062,
        364.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "the tests varied among and within risk groups, with no clear economic consensus around the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.6769104003906,
        260.31622314453125,
        379.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "cost–effectiveness of comparison tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.83489990234375,
        440.1912841796875,
        403.7489013671875
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence of resource requirements (costs)?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.684814453125,
        526.9635009765625,
        427.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "Based on Drummond’s scores, the quality of studies that have assessed cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.184814453125,
        526.9041748046875,
        443.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "C-TST and Diaskintest in this review was concerning; only one out of eight studies was of high",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.684814453125,
        527.1591186523438,
        458.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "quality. However, the quality of the studies that assessed cost–effectiveness of the TST and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.184814453125,
        197.13388061523438,
        474.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "IGRAs was generally high.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.34271240234375,
        524.36572265625,
        498.2567138671875
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.1927490234375,
        526.9674682617188,
        522.3377685546875
      ],
      "text": "Based on the systematic review results, there was insufficient evidence regarding both the cost",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.984188079833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.6927490234375,
        526.965576171875,
        537.8377685546875
      ],
      "text": "and cost–effectiveness of novel TBSTs. The quality of the studies was concerning according to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.1927490234375,
        526.7323608398438,
        553.3377685546875
      ],
      "text": "the Drummond’s checklist for economic evaluations. More high-quality studies are needed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.6927490234375,
        526.9656372070312,
        568.8377685546875
      ],
      "text": "that consider different health settings and risk populations to estimate the cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.1927490234375,
        293.05120849609375,
        584.3377685546875
      ],
      "text": "and the likely economic impact of these tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        595.1965942382812,
        527.278564453125,
        608.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "Results of the Markov-chain model conducted for the purposes of the GDG meeting concluded",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973718643188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.6965942382812,
        526.9041748046875,
        623.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "that, in Brazil, Diaskintest is cost saving compared with the TST and IGRAs. Compared with the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.1965942382812,
        526.9656372070312,
        639.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "TST, Diaskintest is cost saving at $5.60, with an incremental gain of 0.02 QALYs per patient.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.6965942382812,
        526.911865234375,
        654.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "Compared with IGRAs, Diaskintest is cost saving at $8.40, with an incremental gain of 0.01",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.1965942382812,
        526.7501220703125,
        670.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "QALYs. In South Africa, Diaskintest is more cost saving than the TST or IGRAs. Compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.6965942382812,
        526.9644165039062,
        685.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "with the TST, Diaskintest is cost saving at $4.39, with an incremental gain of 0.02 QALYs, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        688.1965942382812,
        526.9644165039062,
        701.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "compared with IGRAs, it is cost saving at $64.41, with an incremental gain of 0.01 QALYs. In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.6965942382812,
        527.1681518554688,
        716.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "the United Kingdom, Diaskintest is cost saving compared with the TST but not with IGRAs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.1965942382812,
        526.9645385742188,
        732.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "Compared with the TST, Diaskintest is cost saving at $73.33, with an incremental gain of 0.04",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.6965942382812,
        526.964599609375,
        747.8416137695312
      ],
      "text": "QALYs; however, compared with IGRAs, Diaskintest showed an increase in cost of $15.80 but",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        750.1965942382812,
        262.26300048828125,
        763.3416137695312
      ],
      "text": "still an incremental gain of 0.03 QALYs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.6684875488281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB infection 135",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}